    "nodesCount": 24,
    "visualStyle": "Dark biomechanical sci-fi horror, transitioning from sterile ruined labs to rusted metal intertwined with pulsating organic matter, ending in a hellish flesh forge, 80s biopunk aesthetic meets HR Giger.",
